{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-23","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","englishTitle":"If there be three magnitudes, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, and the proportion of them be perturbed, they will also be in the same ratio ex aequali.","book":5,"number":23,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":23,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","contentId":"euclid-5-23","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f55e79a36f2bf6ef98910812de460cee12bf0c213034b6da3f11aa4bbb91bfe","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-23.statement","euclid-5-23.construction.1","euclid-5-23.proof.1","euclid-5-23.proof.2","euclid-5-23.proof.3","euclid-5-23.proof.4","euclid-5-23.proof.5","euclid-5-23.proof.6","euclid-5-23.proof.7","euclid-5-23.proof.8","euclid-5-23.proof.9","euclid-5-23.proof.10","euclid-5-23.proof.11","euclid-5-23.proof.12","euclid-5-23.conclusion","euclid-5-23.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-23.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4224f2989300b7591dc0ce8a3d8e981b9ef4f6c90b76fa46326fde4703d81db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If there be three magnitudes, and others equal to them in multitude, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, and the proportion of them be perturbed, they will also be in the same ratio ex aequali."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果有三个等同的等级,而其他等同的等级,即两个和两个等同的等级,两者的比例相同,而且其中的比例也受到干扰,那么它们的比例也是一样的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"89dda40218e8abe043f0030c41b7baead0c3270fa60663090f6db09726d3622c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be three magnitudes A, B, C, and others equal to them in multitude, which, taken two and two together, are in the same proportion, namely D, E, F; and let the proportion of them be perturbed, so that, as A is to B, so is E to F, and, as B is to C, so is D to E; I say that, as A is to C, so is D to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以三等制A、B、C等,其他等同,两者加起来,比例相同,即D、E、F;让其中的比例受到干扰,A-B等同E-F,B与C等同,B与E等同D;我说,A与C等同A与F；A 与 B 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbb37da479dc30d4cbf536aeeca03d34342762224eca47f086e1a1431fb3ebae","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Of A, B, D let equimultiples G, H, K be taken, and of C, E, F other, chance, equimultiples L, M, N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在A中,B、D、同倍数 G、H、K、C、E、F、机会同倍数 L M、N中,B被带走。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"13a6d33c89acede6fb97468fdfed36530805dd46417fdddd72c1d0eabb06e420","citations":["euclid-5-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since G, H are equimultiples of A, B, and parts have the same ratio as the same multiples of them, [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)] therefore, as A is to B, so is G to H."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G以后,H是A中的同倍数,B是B,零部件的比重与A和B相同,因此,A和H的比例等于G和H的比例；A 与 B 之比等于 G 与 H 之比。 [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"068be812c1d1058c410ab783688fb9b680aa8bd4080337fd205b7d69e815d012","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as E is to F, so is M to N. And, as A is to B, so is E to F; therefore also, as G is to H, so is M to N. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,E对F的比等于M对N的比,A对B的比等于E对F的比,因此,G对H的比等于M对N的比；E 与 F 之比等于 M 与 N 之比；A 与 B 之比等于 E 与 F 之比；G 与 H 之比等于 M 与 N 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54100316f97bf06a599a492e47dfe3089f7070fb894b55ce229370005ca22360","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, since, as B is to C, so is D to E, alternately, also, as B is to D, so is C to E. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,B对C的比等于D对E的比,另外,B对D的比等于C对E的比；B 与 C 之比等于 D 与 E 之比；B 与 D 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71af61f53483e955eb00b867f4ad2cbeea71cb35d9e340cc4f6820392c88d550","citations":["euclid-5-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since H, K are equimultiples of B, D, and parts have the same ratio as their equimultiples, therefore, as B is to D, so is H to K. [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自H起,K占B中的同倍数,D占D,零部件与同倍数的比例相同,因此,B与D的比例等于H与K的比例；B 与 D 之比等于 H 与 K 之比。 [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bd43af8d5f4db438c1b2d7798c39e47dc51ed9895722a17b62c9cb60abc4c4f1","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as B is to D, so is C to E; therefore also, as H is to K, so is C to E. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,B对D的比等于C对E的比;因此,H对K的比等于C对E的比；B 与 D 之比等于 C 与 E 之比；H 与 K 之比等于 C 与 E 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c433d5a85640c14c08e64118a4edf5f2a43eceab82acdefd2d14a793496821e","citations":["euclid-5-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since L, M are equimultiples of C, E, therefore, as C is to E, so is L to M. [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自L以来,M占C中的同倍数,E占C,E占E,这相当于L占M；C 与 E 之比等于 L 与 M 之比。 [[V. 15](/principles/euclid-5-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a7d6e22f1b7c61ef89e4633ae9a4b37ca0556879123eb685272cc1676f91af3","citations":["euclid-5-11","euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as C is to E, so is H to K; therefore also, as H is to K, so is L to M, [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] and, alternately, as H is to L, so is K to M. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,C对E的比等于H对K的比;因此,H对K的比等于L对M的比,而H对L对L的比则等于K对M的比；C 与 E 之比等于 H 与 K 之比；H 与 K 之比等于 L 与 M 之比；H 与 L 之比等于 K 与 M 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd4e29b1409736937f9c7ffd5043f4b3cbbb0426a1d0f7a2b57b2ba42047b184","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as G is to H, so is M to N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有证据表明,G对H的比等于M对N的比；G 与 H 之比等于 M 与 N 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc45a628f485dd0f67119f68a96988e54e148f16f475b1248046dcc95af20bec","citations":["euclid-5-21"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since, then, there are three magnitudes G, H, L, and others equal to them in multitude K, M, N, which taken two and two together are in the same ratio, and the proportion of them is perturbed, therefore, ex aequali, if G is in excess of L, K is also in excess of N; if equal, equal; and if less, less. [[V. 21](/principles/euclid-5-21)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,共有3级G、H、L和K等,其中2级和2级加在一起,比例相同,因此,如果G以上超过L,K也超过N,那么比例是平等,如果相等,则相等,如果更少,则更少。（相关点与线段：M） [[V. 21](/principles/euclid-5-21)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a9b5d72a197ade2865e76f007057f53ed93a8fd412e3daf9e02e006a7643eb1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And G, K are equimultiples of A, D, and L, N of C, F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"G,K是A,D的同倍数,C,F的L,N。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5bc0a3a7ede8b64d708b281f1ee1d39fe37952aa2be32e15f9146e70ebbdcfd7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as A is to C, so is D to F."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比C等于D比F；A 与 C 之比等于 D 与 F 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-23.source","contentId":"euclid-5-23","revisionId":"euclid-5-23@raw-8f55e79a36f2bf6e","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6447aee6ddd616fe29edbe0b629e25aa15698bf764354f660dc50efb6ca01e18","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-23.proof.2","euclid-5-23.proof.5","euclid-5-23.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"V. 15"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-23.proof.3","euclid-5-23.proof.6","euclid-5-23.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"V. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-16:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-23.proof.4","euclid-5-23.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-16","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"V. 16"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-21:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-5-23","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-5-23.proof.10"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-21","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.23/","sourceLabel":"V. 21"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-15:explicit","id":"euclid-5-15","book":5,"number":15,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-11:explicit","id":"euclid-5-11","book":5,"number":11,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例相等的传递性","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-16:explicit","id":"euclid-5-16","book":5,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"比例的交错变换","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-5-23:euclid-5-21:explicit","id":"euclid-5-21","book":5,"number":21,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
